# IoT Smart Monitoring CO2 in Industry

This system monitors CO2, temperature and humidity in industrial environments using ESP32 to protect worker health.

## Features
- Real-time CO2 monitoring using MQ-135 sensor
- Temperature & Humidity monitoring using DHT11
- Wi-Fi data sending using MQTT / HTTP
- PHP + MySQL web dashboard for live data
- Buzzer & LED alert when CO2 exceeds safe threshold

## Technologies
- ESP32, C/C++
- MQ-135, DHT11
- PHP, MySQL, HTML/CSS

